    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan Development Network (AKDN) and the Aga Khan University (AKU), in partnership with Fudan University, Tsinghua University and other local partners kicked off a two-day collaborative Population Health Symposium at the Sarova Whitesands Hotel in Mombasa to respond to the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) for the period 2015-2030.",
